id: super-demon-fiendish-evolution
name: Fiendish Evolution
order: 7
slot: mastery
mastery: 2
description: >
  Pushing your power to its functional limit, you evolve into something even greater than a mere demon.
text: >
  Fiendish Evolution (2): Pushing your power to its functional limit, you evolve into something even greater than a mere demon.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you possess 2+ stacks of Demonic Power, Super Demon gains the Armored Aspect.
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Turn, 1/Encounter]: Ignore the 3rd effect of Demonic Pressure.

---

# (1) 2+ stacks of Demonic Power: Armored - an attack's Damage Category 1 lower against you.
[automatic/being-hit, effect 1]
requires demonicpower.stacks >= 2;
incoming.damage.category.shift -= 1;

# (2) Demonic Pressure (3) ignored once an Encounter: the table's.
